                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador McCormick
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick requests to be informed whether the affidavits mentioned in his
                    telegram of the 11th instant have been forwarded.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
